(* Variant control-go-none: the control stream of a Go client to the controller (AUD-5, #389;
   controller/internal/control/stream.go, Dial), against an attacker that is the network and nothing more. The client does
   not check the certificate (InsecureSkipVerify): the Noise_IK handshake with the pinned static key of the controller,
   bound to the TLS exporter, is all that authenticates the controller. ranz-nodesim and the tests of the controller dial
   this way. *)

process
  ( Setup()
  | Sessions(pin_off, bt_export, plabel_control, lab_exp_control, suite_ik)
  )
